// hr_c26: Hive City remaster, the XE metal hall (camera c26).
// No ReflectScale anywhere (the owner: floors were too reflective); the tread-plate floor low in smoothness. smoothness
// scales the _gloss map (R smoothness, G metalness); "default" is the concrete-sound entry, "metal" the metal one.
// pxmat (2026-11-24): + ReliefScale (parallax, textures/<name>_hmap), ReflectScale on metal/glass/lamps (floors stay dry), detailmap.
"hr_c26_wall"
{
	"material" "metal"
	"smoothness" "0.4"
	"ReliefScale" "0.07"
	"ReflectScale" "0.35"
	"detailmap" "textures/detail/pxd_concrete"
	"detailScale" "8"
}
